{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s15-p01",
      "text": "Last year I had a trip with my friend Nancy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p02",
      "text": "We enjoyed sandwiches and shared a jar of honey tea over lunch.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p03",
      "text": "The weather was cloudy except for one night.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p04",
      "text": "Wearing comfortable skirts, Nancy and I camped in the field after dinner.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p05",
      "text": "I listened to her playing the guitar and we felt relaxed.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p06",
      "text": "Looking at the stars, we started a hunt for the brightest one.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p07",
      "text": "'It's a pity we don't know which stars we're looking at, Jenny,' said Nancy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p08",
      "text": "'I know some of them,' I answered.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p09",
      "text": "Nancy felt surprised when I finally finished telling her all the names I knew.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p10",
      "text": "My interest in stars began when I was eight.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p11",
      "text": "My aunt Mrs Hill took me to a planetarium.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p12",
      "text": "A guide showed us the groups of stars, and told us stories about how they got their names.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p13",
      "text": "The stories were wonderful.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p14",
      "text": "I even saw some X-ray images of the stars there.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p15",
      "text": "It felt like standing in front of the gate of knowledge.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p16",
      "text": "I took a course at the club to learn more about stars.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p17",
      "text": "I realised that in addition to clouds, a bright moon also stops us seeing stars clearly.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p18",
      "text": "I always look for the Plough, because once I see that, I can find the North Star and other stars.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p19",
      "text": "There are so many lights in the city that we have to go into the countryside to see any stars.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p20",
      "text": "I'm planning to make videos about stars in the countryside.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p21",
      "text": "I'll post them online for everyone to watch.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15-p22",
      "text": "My greatest dream is to be an astronaut and I wish I could have a space travel.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s15-p22.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
